# The demonstration ledger is BUILT, not committed.
#
# Measured, not assumed: two builds produce an identical `actions_audit` -- 107 rows,
# the same row_hash on every one -- and a different FILE, because the engine samples the
# clock for schema_migrations.applied_at, policy_versions.created_at and the config
# stamps. None of those is an input the generator can pin.
#
# So the pinned artifact is HEAD, one line, committed beside this file. That is what the
# anti-masquerade check compares a citation against, and it is exactly the part that is
# deterministic. It also keeps the wheel small: the database measured 315 KB, over the
# 256 KB the ticket declared.
demo-ledger.db
demo-ledger.db-*
